+  /* Computes |r = g_scalar*generator + p_scalar*p| if |g_scalar| and |p_scalar|
+   * are both non-null. Computes |r = g_scalar*generator| if |p_scalar| is null.
+   * Computes |r = p_scalar*p| if g_scalar is null. At least one of |g_scalar|
